##### leakage_demo #####
running protocols (same data, same classifier, same features)...

  A   32.72%   leave-one-subject-out
      12 folds, one per held-out subject
  B   37.87%   random split over trials, subjects pooled
      1079 trials pooled, 5 random 80/20 splits
  C   43.25%   random split over sliding windows
      18343 windows (4 s, 0.5 s step, ~17 per trial), 5 random 80/20 splits
  D   79.28%   channel-as-sample with the label bug
      31288 raw-intensity windows, 2 channels x 12 subjects = 24 channel groups; majority class 45.7%, channel-identity oracle 100.0%

